["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Controlling Biology - Fabian Theis, Helmholtz Munich world model bitter lesson organoid flow matching Lab Compass\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latentspace-一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷-线性模型打平了多数深度模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">50:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>一場著名的虛擬細胞競賽爆冷：線性模型打平了多數深度模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場頂級虛擬細胞競賽證明，簡單線性迴歸能打平許多深度學習模型——問題不在數據信息不夠，而在評測指標和訓練目標本身設計有問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">虛擬細胞</span><span class=\"tag\">擾動預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brain development in the clinic and the classroom | Karen Parker &amp; Jason Yeatman (with the Future of Everything podcast) RCT Spark\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-fromourneurons-教育产品没人做随机对照试验-因为验证了也不赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>教育產品沒人做隨機對照試驗，因為驗證了也不賺錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">學校採購教材靠銷售代表講故事打動老師和學區領導，沒有監管要求證明效果，證明一款產品比另一款好並不會帶來利潤，所以沒人願意出錢去驗證。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">循證醫學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257 對話少楠：明明 AI 有問必答，我怎麼還總是信息焦慮？ OPC OpenClaw Amor fati 鄭州幫 Lindy Effect 式年遷宮\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-zhixing-答案越来越便宜-真正稀缺的是选一个下注的勇气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ded4f15035f3605-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>答案越來越便宜，真正稀缺的是選一個下注的勇氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少楠認為，AI讓答案變得唾手可得，但人真正要面對的不是信息匱乏，而是在無窮可能性裡敢不敢選一個、下注、然後把時間交出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">AI工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Salesforce’s $100 Billion M&amp;A Playbook | John Somorjai AOV ISV red teaming outcome-based pricing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-a16z-salesforce并购负责人-好技术没有分销渠道-照样会被饿死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Salesforce併購負責人：好技術沒有分銷渠道，照樣會被餓死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Somorjai說，軟件寫起來比以往更快更便宜，但初創公司要靠自己搭起能觸達全部客戶的銷售網絡，仍要花很多年、不斷稀釋股權——這正是併購對Salesforce和被收購方都成立的價值所在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">併購</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"America Votes Against Data Centers, Implications for Big Tech and Beyond, Were Google Bears Right All Along? smiling curve Neoclouds Google Capital Company group chat era\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-sharptech-选民几乎全票否决数据中心-但赢家大概率还是大厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>選民幾乎全票否決數據中心，但贏家大概率還是大廠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">44個反對數據中心的地方公投中43個通過，連市長議員都被罷免，但資本、信貸和土地優勢仍集中在亞馬遜、谷歌這類大廠手裡，算力越稀缺它們反而越佔便宜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Screens in School: What EdTech and AI Are Doing to How Kids Learn transpersonal emergent property NAEP formative vs summative assessment ISIL literacy test\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-raisinggh-人手一台校发电脑后-z世代数字素养反而不如千禧一代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed6c6b0156a06fc6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">59:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>人手一臺校發電腦後，Z世代數字素養反而不如千禧一代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工具在你學會某項技能之前介入，是確保你學不會這項技能的頭號方式——這正是美國88%學生人手一臺校發電腦後，數字素養代際倒退的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育科技</span><span class=\"tag\">數字素養</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reading the Anthropic S-1, with Zvi Mowshowitz S-1 closing the loop pacing the frontier cohort economics net revenue retention bootloader\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-complexsys-anthropic三季度放缓不是需求退潮-是算力不够卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/20604db48920535f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic三季度放緩不是需求退潮，是算力不夠賣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股書顯示三季度一半算力支出靠5億美元的高價現貨市場填——長約算力早被排滿，不是客戶不想買token了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO招股書</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ramtin Naimi - The State of Venture - [Invest Like the Best, EP.499] cuck tranche NeoLab BCI benchmark maxing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-ilt-风投最赚钱的打法一旦变成共识-可能就不再赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bcdceac3abfefaf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>風投最賺錢的打法一旦變成共識，可能就不再賺錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當大批VC都擠著當Databricks、Anthropic這類確定性標的的被動股東時，Naimi提醒：歷史上幾乎沒有一種大家都覺得簡單的策略，長期還能跑贏市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一級市場</span><span class=\"tag\">基金募資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Macro Implications of the Blue Tsunami S-1 Dunning-Kruger effect filibuster blue tsunami\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-oddlots-建数据中心最积极的几个州-一夜之间全都成了民主党州长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>建數據中心最積極的幾個州，一夜之間全都成了民主黨州長</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從得州到弗吉尼亞，數據中心建設重鎮的州長清一色轉向民主黨，過去默認的稅收優惠和零監管環境正被重新談判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國大選</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Milk Cartons &quot;Scared the Bejesus Out of a Generation&quot; - with Roman Mars Century Safe Bundy clock Taylorism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-cautionary-牛奶盒寻人运动吓坏一代美国人-却没找回一个孩子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>牛奶盒尋人運動嚇壞一代美國人，卻沒找回一個孩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛奶盒上的失蹤兒童照片讓一代美國人提防陌生人綁架，但節目追溯下來，它從未真正幫著找回一個孩子，卻掩蓋了貧困與家暴這些更常見的兒童危險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童安全</span><span class=\"tag\">泰勒制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"185: Anthropic招股書丨與Amont李肇宇聊定價邏輯和潛在風險 NRR ARR FDE operating lease / financial lease Neo Cloud bare metal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-anthropic招股书没敢给的数字-决定了ipo估值天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">59:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股書沒敢給的數字，決定了IPO估值天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">招股書迴避了唯一關鍵數字——10月流水；市值能否站上1.5萬億美元，全看這個數字能否撐住年底1000億美元年化收入的外推邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"186: Anthropic招股書丨“銀行也有百億預算”，與Fusion Fund張璐聊大企業在想什麼 Physical AI Net Revenue Retention (NRR) Business Automation / Business Optimization AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latetalk-银行ai预算破百亿-却难复制coding的爆发速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d307b4093cb28d05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>銀行AI預算破百億，卻難複製Coding的爆發速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀行、藥企把AI預算提到史上最高優先級，但張璐認為企業真正改掉工作流程要經歷自動化和優化兩個階段，不可能像寫代碼一樣一年內爆發。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">2B投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"KYC Becomes KYA: Sentinel Bio&#x27;s Joshua Monrad on DNA Screening, Uplift Studies &amp; Agent Monitoring uplift study KYA (Know Your Agent) tacit knowledge managed access regime reverse genetics protocol\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-cogrev-病毒合成能力已不缺ai-缺的是机器人的灵巧双手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/708f88bf8d7da201-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>病毒合成能力已不缺AI，缺的是機器人的靈巧雙手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Monrad認為模型智能已接近夠用，但把設計變成活病毒仍需精細溼實驗操作——這靠機器人的靈巧雙手，現在的機器人還不夠靈巧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI風險治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Destroying Tumors With Sound: Histotripsy with Dr. Zhen Xu histotripsy cavitation HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound) diffraction limit Golden Goose Award\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-fromfirstprinc-超声波震碎肝肿瘤-意外让大鼠体内其它肿瘤自行消失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfee2881de7968b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>超聲波震碎肝腫瘤，意外讓大鼠體內其它腫瘤自行消失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鼠肝腫瘤實驗裡，被超聲波部分擊碎的腫瘤組裡9/11只不僅未擴散，連未處理的殘留病灶也消失——機制是釋放抗原激活了全身免疫反應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療技術</span><span class=\"tag\">腫瘤免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An AI disaster hits. The president calls Xi. Then what? | Jeremie Harris (crosspost from NonZero) scaling laws superalignment AI Chernobyl track 1.5 / track 2 dialogue MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction) subthreshold warfare\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-eightythousand-中美ai协议靠的不是互信-而是总统感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ef61ed5d89280cd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:22:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>中美AI協議靠的不是互信，而是總統感到自己可能被炸死的那一刻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他預判會出現一次足夠嚴重的AI事故，讓總統本人感到性命堪憂——那一刻美國才會單邊暫停訓練，並靠切斷電纜、網絡攻擊之類的威脅逼中國同步收手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"你相信光嗎：把幾萬個GPU用光連起來，到底有多難？| 一期視頻看懂共封裝光學（CPO） CPO OIO UCIE microring modulator MZI WDM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-laoshi-光刻机已经到了人类工程极限-却仍锁不住微环芯片的波长/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9493e7e74192a076-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">53:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>光刻機已經到了人類工程極限，卻仍鎖不住微環芯片的波長</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硅光學界曾判定微環因波長漂移無法量產，這家公司造了一臺激光退火修條設備，把波長良率做到99%，繞開了對頂級光刻機的依賴。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光互聯</span><span class=\"tag\">CPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Merve Demirel on the Costs of Migrating for Higher Education in India discrete choice experiment non-pecuniary costs willingness to pay migration penalty\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-ideasofindia-真人学长电话劝学-也劝不动印度学生去孟买上大学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f234d180c819c9b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">52:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>真人學長電話勸學，也勸不動印度學生去孟買上大學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">給同齡老鄉打電話介紹大城市的大學生活後，學生申請本地地級市的比例漲了，但申請孟買、浦那的比例紋絲不動——擋住他們的不是信息，是搬家本身的真實代價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">遷移決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New CFO: How AI Is Rewriting the Finance Function | Figma CFO Praveer Melwani vibe coding ETL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-a16z-figma-cfo-业务复杂度不变-团队一年后就该变少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>Figma CFO：業務複雜度不變，團隊一年後就該變少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">對賬、併購盡調原型、投資備忘錄生成已被AI壓縮到分鐘級，Figma CFO Praveer Melwani認為，一旦業務複雜度不再增長，財務團隊的人力需求本身會隨之收縮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI財務</span><span class=\"tag\">CFO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tokenization, Agentic Trading, Harmonic: Robinhood&#x27;s Mission to Expand Ownership with CEO Vlad Tenev MCP KPI contracts license to operate accredited investor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-nopriors-加密货币靠散户持有赢了政治战-ai却把散户完全排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd877a74a55b6594-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>加密貨幣靠散戶持有贏了政治戰，AI卻把散戶完全排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">散戶從一開始就持有加密貨幣，因此在監管收緊時能組織起來反擊；但私募市場把普通人擋在AI獨角獸的融資輪外，只能承受數據中心的噪音和失業風險，卻分不到一分錢漲幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代幣化</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Breaking Down Our Investment Portfolios | #434 benign neglect idiosyncratic risk covered call fund income satiation Fama-French five-factor model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-rationalreminder-这位信奉指数投资的基金经理-却把大笔身家押在自己公司股票上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>這位信奉指數投資的基金經理，卻把大筆身家押在自己公司股票上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ben明知「別重倉僱主股票」是常識，仍把被收購的PWL股權轉入OneDigital——他說這是自己主動選的特質風險，因為他是公司參與者，不是領薪水的旁觀者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Music Can Be Medicine, with Dr. Dan Levitin default mode network endogenous opioids basal ganglia aphantasia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-sciencevs-音乐止痛是真实的神经机制-但你得先喜欢这首歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>音樂止痛是真實的神經機制，但你得先喜歡這首歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學家用冰桶測試證實，喜歡的音樂會讓大腦釋放堪比嗎啡的內源性阿片類物質來提升痛覺閾值，而討厭的音樂只會釋放皮質醇讓人更緊張。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音樂治療</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Bosworth on What Comes After Lula&#x27;s Stunning Win status of forces agreement chavistas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-oddlots-巴西大选次轮变成对首轮领先者的公投-押注87-的预测市场全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>巴西大選次輪變成對首輪領先者的公投，押注87%的預測市場全錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為選民厭惡現任者，首輪投票選出的「贏家」反而把全部火力引向自己，讓原本落後的盧拉在次輪完成反超。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span><span class=\"tag\">巴西大選</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Health Insurance in America Blue Cross Red Scare Campaigns, Inc. wage and price controls\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-throughline-锁定美国雇主医保的不是二战意外-而是艾森豪威尔的选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1989x1989+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F02%2F15%2Fa2ebac794881a9c592b8881be551%2F4c34746d-230d-4248-8438-6f7a55f11d5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>鎖定美國僱主醫保的不是二戰意外，而是艾森豪威爾的選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二戰工資管制只是讓僱主醫保偶然發芽，真正讓它變成美國永久制度的，是1950年代艾森豪威爾政府主動把這項稅收優惠永久寫進法律。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫保史</span><span class=\"tag\">僱主醫保</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Britain&#x27;s First Homo Sapiens LRJ (Lincombeian-Ranisian-Jerzmanowician) leaf points marine isotope stage 3 (MIS3) prism system Aurignacian\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-05-ancients-英国最早智人化石的年代-可能被保存用的胶水测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5d9c468a9839ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1105</span></div>\n<h2>英國最早智人化石的年代，可能被保存用的膠水測錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這塊1927年出土的下頜骨被測定為三萬五千年前，但修復用的膠水會讓放射性碳測年失真，研究者認為實際年代應該更早。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">舊石器時代</span><span class=\"tag\">尼安德特人</span>\n</div></div></a>"]